What it changes: a pass state set from a material property ("ColorMask [_ColorMask]",
"Stencil { Ref [_Stencil] }", "ZTest [unity_GUIZTestMode]", "Blend [_SrcBlend] [_DstBlend]") is
stored as the property's name next to its default value. USCSandbox wrote the value, so the
TextMeshPro shaders came out with "ColorMask 0" and drew nothing. It writes the reference.
Applied after uscsandbox-swizzle.patch. Lines before the first diff are a comment.

